  "prefLabel": "Nuh 403.02 CEU Forms",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-03-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 403.02 CEU Forms. All nursing home administrators shall report CEU programs or courses with a “Continuing Education Form” provided by the board by stating the following:\n\n(a) The name and home address of the nursing home administrator;\n\n(b) The home phone number of the nursing home administrator;\n\n(c) The nursing home administrator’s place of employment, employment address, and work phone number;\n\n(d) The date, topic, and sponsoring organization of course attended;\n\n(e) Number of CEU clock hours;\n\n(f) A copy of the certificate of attendance for each course; and\n\n(g) The applicant’s dated signature attesting that there are no willful misrepresentations in or falsifications of the information provided.\n\nSource. #7663, eff 3-19-02, EXPIRED: 3-19-10\n\nNew. #9830-B, eff, 12-10-10; ss #12690, eff 12-19-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nuh100-500.html"
